sitory/commits/b505adfa1b8b87f974ff9e2a41d7433574155812", "html_url": "https://github.com/ocaml/opam-repository/commit/b505adfa1b8b87f974ff9e2a41d7433574155812"}]}, {"sha": "b505adfa1b8b87f974ff9e2a41d7433574155812", "node_id": "C_kwDOAETL7doAKGI1MDVhZGZhMWI4Yjg3Zjk3NGZmOWUyYTQxZDc0MzM1NzQxNTU4MTI", "commit": {"author": {"name": "Marcello Seri", "email": "mseri@users.noreply.github.com", "date": "2023-01-17T20:46:21Z"}, "committer": {"name": "Etienne Millon", "email": "me@emillon.org", "date": "2023-01-18T16:43:07Z"}, "message": "ahrocksdb: fix lower bounds\n\ndune-project file requires dune 1.3 and ctypes needs to be 0.13.0 due to\n```\n#=== ERROR while compiling ahrocksdb.0.2.1 ====================================#\n# context              2.2.0~alpha~dev | linux/x86_64 | ocaml-base-compiler.4.08.1 | pinned(https://github.com/ahrefs/ocaml-ahrocksdb/releases/download/0.2.1/ahrocksdb-0.2.1.tbz)\n# path                 ~/.opam/4.08/.opam-switch/build/ahrocksdb.0.2.1\n# command              ~/.opam/opam-init/hooks/sandbox.sh build dune build -p ahrocksdb -j 71\n# exit-code            1\n# env-file             ~/.opam/log/ahrocksdb-7-231d82.env\n# output-file          ~/.opam/log/ahrocksdb-7-231d82.out\n### output ###\n#       ocamlc ffi/structs/.rocksdb_types.objs/rocksdb_types.{cmi,cmo,cmt} (exit 2)\n# (cd _build/default && /home/opam/.opam/4.08/bin/ocamlc.opt -w -40 -g -bin-annot -I ffi/structs/.rocksdb_types.objs -I ffi/structs/.rocksdb_types.objs/.private -I /home/opam/.opam/4.08/lib/bytes -I /home/opam/.opam/4.08/lib/ctypes -I /home/opam/.opam/4.08/lib/integers -no-alias-deps -o ffi/structs/.rocksdb_types.objs/rocksdb_types.cmo -c -impl ffi/structs/rocksdb_types.ml)\n# File \"ffi/structs/rocksdb_types.ml\", line 1, characters 24-35:\n# 1 | module Struct_stubs(S : Ctypes.TYPE) = struct\n#                             ^^^^^^^^^^^\n# Error: Unbound module type Ctypes.TYPE\n```", "tree": {"sha": "a604c1c1af0e43653dd99c2a37530618d6b9dc54", "url": "https://api.github.com